# Exclude common files not needed in build
.git
*.md
!CLAUDE.md
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
*~

# Tests and the devcontainer template run on the host, never inside the
# image. Keeping them out of the context also keeps every file Apple
# Containers has to transfer under its 16k-per-file limit.
tests
devcontainer
.claude

# The Go launcher: sources build on the host, and bin/ holds a multi-megabyte
# binary that has no business being shipped to the builder. Note that the
# top-level `*.md` above does not match nested paths, so .scratch needs its own
# entry.
go.mod
go.sum
Makefile
cmd
internal
bin
.scratch
